flowchart LR
H["Human authority"] --> DI["Design intelligence<br/>human • external frontier model • Reverend Architect"]
DI --> SP["SpecificationPackage<br/>versioned • hashed • human accepted"]
SP --> V["Validation / normalization"]
V --> PT["Requirements • Decisions • AcceptanceCriteria • contracts"]
PT --> R["Run pinned to exact specification version"]
R --> DAG["Task DAG"]
DAG --> A["Agent / Team implementation"]
A --> DET["Build • tests • benchmarks • simulations • Git/CI"]
DET --> VER["Independent verification"]
A -->|architecture ambiguity| ESC["EscalationArtifact"]
DET -->|contract conflict| ESC
ESC --> DI
DI -->|approved amendment / clarification| PT
